{
  "schema": 1,
  "id": "mosaic",
  "name": "Mosaic",
  "version": "0.3.0",
  "description": "The target's pivot: a row of light lowercase headers over a grid of flat tiles in three sizes, green for places and actions, art for things, live tiles cycling; libraries as hubs with posters two rows deep running sideways; details as a pivot of the item's sections over its darkened backdrop; white panels and lists with a green focus for everything else; a guide panel over any screen.",
